      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790739739842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We feel like there is some really important things happening in the AT Protocol\nthat can unlock the web that we all want -- even if we don't know we want it.\nThe trouble is it seems to be hidden behind overly technical discussions and the\nwork is happening largely outside of the public's view.  \n\nOur goal with this project is to do our part to bridge that gap. \n\nWe intend to create short, clear, and digestible content delivered through an\nintuitive user experience on this site. It'll be a delicate balance but we're up to\nthe challenge.  Come back to see how we're doing or follow up on Bluesky!",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We feel like there is some really important things happening in the AT Protocol that can unlock the web that we all want -- even if we don't know we want it. The trouble is it seems to be hidden behind overly technical discussions and the work is happening largely outside of the public's view.  \n\nOur goal with this project is to do our part to bridge that gap. \n\nWe intend to create short, clear, and digestible content delivered through an intuitive user experience on this site. It'll be a delicate balance but we're up to the challenge.  Come back to see how we're doing or follow up on Bluesky!",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
